<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/tespm110"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2016-05-02</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Altersklasse</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Age class</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Classe d&apos;âge</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Quantil</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Quantile</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Quantile</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Grund</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Reason</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Raison</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geschlecht</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Sex</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Sexe</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Maßeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Unit of measure</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Unité de mesure</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Self-reported unmet need for medical care by sex</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">Self-reported unmet needs for medical care concern a person’s own assessment of whether he or she needed examination or treatment for a specific type of health care, but did not have it or did not seek it because of the following three reasons: ‘Financial reasons’, ‘Waiting list’ and ‘Too far to travel’. Medical care refers to individual healthcare services (medical examination or treatment excluding dental care) provided by or under direct supervision of medical doctors or equivalent professions according to national healthcare systems. Data are collected from the European Statistics of Income and Living Condition survey and refer to such needs during the previous 12 months. Data are expressed as percentages within the population aged 16 years old and over living in private households.</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Besoins auto-déclarés d&apos;examen ou de traitement médical non satisfaits par sexe</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">Le renoncement aux soins déclaré est l&apos;auto-évaluation faite par une personne qui avait besoin d&apos;être examiné pour des raisons de santé ou de recevoir un traitement mais qui a dû y renoncer pour une des trois raisons suivantes: &quot;raisons financières&quot;, &quot;liste d&apos;attente&quot; ou &quot;trop éloigné pour se déplacer&quot;. Les soins se réfèrent à des soins de santé (examen médical ou traitement à l&apos;exclusion des soins dentaires) fourni ou sur la supervision d&apos;un médecin ou d&apos;une profession équivalente dans le système de santé national. Les données sont collectées dans l&apos;Enquête européenne sur les statistiques de revenus et les conditions de vie et elles se réfèrent aux 12 derniers mois. Les résultats sont exprimés en pourcentage sur le champ de la population âgée de 16 ans ou plus et qui vit en ménage privé ordinaire.</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Nach eigenen Angaben nicht erfüllter Bedarf nach ärztlicher Untersuchung oder Behandlung nach Geschlecht</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">Nach eigenen Angaben nicht erfüllter Bedarf nach ärztlicher Untersuchung oder Behandlung besteht nach eigener Beurteilung der Frage, ob er oder sie ärztliche Untersuchungen oder Behandlungen benötigten, aber nicht bekommen haben oder in Anspruch genommen haben aufgrund einer der drei folgenden Ursachen: „finanzielle Gründe&quot;, „Warteliste&quot;, „Anfahrt zu lang&quot;. Ärztliche Untersuchungen bezieht sich auf individuellen Gesundheitsleistungen (ärztliche Untersuchungen oder Behandlungen ausgeschlossen zahnärztliche Versorgung) die durchgeführt wurden entweder durch oder unter direkter Aufsicht von Ärzten oder Angehörigen gleichwertiger Berufe im nationalen Gesundheitssystem. Daten werden durch die EU-Erhebung über Einkommen und Lebensbedingungen (EU-SILC) gesammelt und beziehen sich auf Bedarfe innerhalb der letzten 12 Monate. Angaben sind in Prozent der Bevölkerung über 16 Jahren, die in einem privaten Haushalt leben, ausgedrückt.</dct:description><dct:identifier>tespm110</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tespm110"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EUR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ISL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NOR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CHE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GBR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MNE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MKD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ALB"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SRB"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct: